{"id":"n70613-2-7","stage":5,"title":"예언 · 预言","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70613-2-7-1","ko":"예언 은사를 받은 사람이 있대. 우리도 가 보자.","zh":"听说有人拥有预言的天赋呢。我们也去看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예언","meaning":"预言","explanation":"예언：预言","readings":[{"term":"예언","audio":"/audio/8c5b79661bc6a39c7a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70613","senseId":"1","lemma":"예언","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예언","audio":"/audio/8c5b79661bc6a39c7a15.mp3"}},{"text":"은사를","meaning":"恩赐","explanation":"은사：恩赐；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"은사","audio":"/audio/a0aaa1b45528e83bafc7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71171","senseId":"2","lemma":"은사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"은사를","audio":"/audio/725494a9c42206561c84.mp3"}},{"text":"받은","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받은","audio":"/audio/135720fd9fd0e73d4239.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"있대.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있대","audio":"/audio/fa6a514e8d5681c63f41.mp3"}},{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보자","audio":"/audio/0434c803cb8571c9cf8e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8c5b79661bc6a39c","term":"예언","zh":"预言","audio":"/audio/8c5b79661bc6a39c7a15.mp3","entryId":"70613","definition":"知道或推测未来的事情并说；或指那样的言论。","pronunciation":["예ː언"]},{"id":"a0aaa1b45528e83b","term":"은사","zh":"恩赐","audio":"/audio/a0aaa1b45528e83bafc7.mp3","entryId":"71171","definition":"在基督教中，上帝赋予人的才能。","pronunciation":["은사"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/24728ddea6589cc45475.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70613-2-7-2","ko":"난 싫어. 예언 능력이 있다는 말 못 믿겠어.","zh":"我不要。我才不信什么有人有预言能力这种话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"싫어.","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫어","audio":"/audio/fb109362c8ef3fae2aaf.mp3"}},{"text":"예언","meaning":"预言","explanation":"예언：预言","readings":[{"term":"예언","audio":"/audio/8c5b79661bc6a39c7a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70613","senseId":"1","lemma":"예언","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예언","audio":"/audio/8c5b79661bc6a39c7a15.mp3"}},{"text":"능력이","meaning":"能力，才能","explanation":"능력：能力，才能；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"능력","audio":"/audio/f9c5a220974330b54c6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61285","senseId":"1","lemma":"능력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"능력이","audio":"/audio/b27659720f01391cc519.mp3"}},{"text":"있다는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다는","audio":"/audio/3f5b0975fb8e95c3b8db.mp3"}},{"text":"말","meaning":"传言，消息","explanation":"말：传言，消息","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sourc